      "target_id": "XML:2703547",
      "text": "辰. 违反本法第二十五条之二第一款（包括依本法第二十六条第八款"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00173",
      "source_hash": "4fa9b289130d6d54752d7283cef10eb1aa4ba80dbc6db71175a69c76611173d4",
      "target_id": "XML:2703548",
      "text": "本法第七十五条"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00177",
      "source_hash": "6ef028cecb0615af8dfccc3f754e33d324307f6dfb014db4b27fe616f25ac8d6",
      "target_id": "XML:2703552",
      "text": "准用的情形），"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00178",
      "source_hash": "b3c95d4539395fcadf1baa110cdd559df1569974492d098f736a8bcdf9dba9d4",
      "target_id": "XML:2703553",
      "text": "第二款第十一号"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00179",
      "source_hash": "7da0072b064283d9e7973905ef45133c926be6989d5129cf993b39f6ccc03c5c",
      "target_id": "XML:2703554",
      "text": "拍摄人或与该人有关物体的影像的情形"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00180",
      "source_hash": "8b64215266450e2f3e30e97b82b079dec0ab9fc597057e4aadaf0926c90408a2",
      "target_id": "XML:2703555",
      "text": "巳. "
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00181",
      "source_hash": "2e1e1779d0fe405e88acd43e2ba253846095ecd1268db40fa12d57e08a9b5895",
      "target_id": "XML:2703556",
      "text": "违反本法第二十五条之二第二款（包括依本法第二十六条第八款"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00182",
      "source_hash": "4fa9b289130d6d54752d7283cef10eb1aa4ba80dbc6db71175a69c76611173d4",
      "target_id": "XML:2703557",
      "text": "本法第七十五条"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00186",
      "source_hash": "2905daaddf20848bd30c567bc30da522c5c1d4e9b80b7b152fd3ddb650e2aad3",
