      "text": "准用的情形），"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00187",
      "source_hash": "421c7b60ad5cdc158d4503f2c2f520686960bc9505e644ca4e1c8cbe6042bb3e",
      "target_id": "XML:2703562",
      "text": "第一款第二号"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00188",
      "source_hash": "493a53523e49f7ba4858f1b57975552e6c1fa29563d73ec46b5829283e644dae",
      "target_id": "XML:2703563",
      "text": "使用移动式影像信息处理设备拍摄人或与该人"
    },
    {
      "id": "A37057-zh-00189",
      "source_hash": "1b5f888199da601fa680d1d9271796332d2eeb113018892c12d3a92b42a97723",
      "target_id": "XML:2703564",
